PartialFillSettler_finaliseAsCancelled
├── when _hashOrder(order) is not equal to orderId
│   └── it should revert with DigestMismatch
├── when orderStatus[orderId] is not Opened
│   └── it should revert with InvalidOrderStatus
├── when cellar.rolled[orderDigest] is greater than zero OR totalDstCstEscrowed[orderDigest] is greater than zero
│   └── it should revert with OrderHasFills
├── when status is Opened AND no fills AND msg.sender equals order.user
│   └── it should transition status from Opened to Cancelled and emit OrderFinalised with status Cancelled
├── when status is Opened AND no fills AND cancelSig is a valid maker cancel sig
│   └── it should succeed via the gasless UW cancel path
├── when cancelSig is invalid
│   └── it should revert with NotMaker
├── when cancelSig signs a different orderId
│   └── it should revert with NotMaker
├── when any filler attempted a ZeroRollover rollover fill with no state written
│   └── it should still succeed from Opened (no fill state, escrow empty)
└── when called after fillDeadline AND status is Opened AND no fills exist
    └── it should still succeed (cancel is independent of deadline)
